        "id": "A",
        "text": "方程 (I)：$x^2-9x+10=0$；$\\left(x-\\frac{9}{2}\\right)^2=\\frac{41}{4}$；解集为 $\\left\\{\\frac{9-\\sqrt{41}}{2},\\frac{9+\\sqrt{41}}{2}\\right\\}$。",
        "figure_ids": []
      },
      {
        "id": "B",
        "text": "方程 (II)：$x^2+\\frac{3}{5}x-\\frac{8}{5}=0$；$\\left(x+\\frac{3}{10}\\right)^2=\\frac{169}{100}$；解集为 $\\left\\{-\\frac{8}{5},1\\right\\}$。",
        "figure_ids": []
      },
      {
        "id": "C",
        "text": "方程 (I)：$x^2-\\frac{9}{2}x+5=0$；$\\left(x-\\frac{9}{4}\\right)^2=\\frac{1}{16}$；解集为 $\\left\\{2,\\frac{5}{2}\\right\\}$。",
        "figure_ids": []
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "text": "方程 (II)：$x^2+\\frac{3}{5}x-8=0$；$\\left(x+\\frac{3}{10}\\right)^2=\\frac{809}{100}$；解集为 $\\left\\{\\frac{-3-\\sqrt{809}}{10},\\frac{-3+\\sqrt{809}}{10}\\right\\}$。",
        "figure_ids": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "n43-square-difference-proof": {
    "mode": "single",
    "stem": "两个实数 $u,v$ 满足 $u+v=\\sqrt{10}$，$u-v=\\sqrt{6}$。\n\n下面哪条确定乘积 $uv$ 的完整推导中，每一个等号都成立？",
    "figure_ids": [],
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "text": "$2uv=(u+v)^2-(u-v)^2=10-6=4$，所以 $uv=2$。",
        "figure_ids": []
      },
      {
        "id": "B",
        "text": "$4uv=(u+v)^2-(u-v)^2=10-6=4$，所以 $uv=1$。",
        "figure_ids": []
      },
      {
        "id": "C",
        "text": "$4uv=(u+v)^2+(u-v)^2=10+6=16$，所以 $uv=4$。",
        "figure_ids": []
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "text": "$uv=(u+v)(u-v)=\\sqrt{10}\\sqrt{6}=\\sqrt{60}$，所以 $uv=2\\sqrt{15}$。",
        "figure_ids": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
